<dl>
  <dt>What is Scouting?</dt>
  <dd>
    Scouting is a worldwide movement that aims to support young people in their
    physical, mental, and spiritual development, so that they may play
    constructive roles in society. It is a non-formal educational program that
    encourages young people to develop skills, values, and attitudes that will
    help them become responsible citizens and leaders.
  </dd>
</dl>
